  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.75 cup packed brown sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "2 tablespoons milk",
    "0.5 cup milk chocolate chips",
    "0.5 cup mini chocolate chips"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0H66gfD32vDOEM_Y-bnfAMQWn7E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255365-Edible-Cookie-Dough-DDMFS-Step-01a-1160-9a0aa67eed7d4ecdb8f5f933b9995d3a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255365/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To heat-treat your flour so it is safe to use: Place flour in a microwave-safe dish and cook for 1 minute and 15 seconds, stirring it every 15 seconds. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yIlD5DK5yQK9D5-kGWvN8xLYR4M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255365-Edible-Cookie-Dough-DDMFS-Step-01b-1162-cb460a183fb0481aa5348bd4547c2c26.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255365/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar and butter with an electric mixer in a large bowl until creamy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GqvtlU8GGxZqPXoHsfhftfH0jfA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255365-Edible-Cookie-Dough-DDMFS-Step-02-1163-f8dc2fd924264b138393d2538b4e2027.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255365/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in vanilla extract and salt. Add heat-treated flour; mix until a crumbly dough forms.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/at9M8OWZot377xKjkVxBChFOF6M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255365-Edible-Cookie-Dough-DDMFS-Step-03-1164-1-87021715b5b145dda57cd6015423e385.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255365/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in milk until dough is just combined; fold in milk chocolate chips and mini chocolate chips.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qfqpXIJXNNtdm6R-h0hwiYyJ6pI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255365-Edible-Cookie-Dough-DDMFS-Step-04b-1166-ca08a5e1b1454260bdb7e06053b16e80.jpg"
